  "title": "Vegan Arepas Made with Polenta",
  "description": "Layers of polenta, tofu, bananas, avocado, and mango salsa combine for a surprising and simple vegan meal.",
  "authors": [
    "angloesque"
  ],
  "date_published": "2009-03-21T13:08:19-04:00",
